    "sections": {
        "description": "ST House Keeping is a clean, modern, and professionally designed WordPress theme created specifically for housekeeping, cleaning services, maid agencies, home maintenance providers, janitorial companies, and related businesses. The theme features a fully responsive layout that looks great on desktops, tablets, and mobile devices, ensuring an excellent user experience across all screen sizes. With its user-friendly customization options, you can easily personalize colors, fonts, layouts, and content without any coding knowledge. ST House Keeping includes dedicated sections for services, about us, testimonials, team members, contact information, and call-to-action areas to help showcase your business effectively. Built with SEO-friendly code and optimized performance, the theme helps improve search engine visibility and website loading speed. Whether you're launching a new cleaning business website or upgrading an existing one, ST House Keeping provides a professional and reliable online presence."
    },
